  "description": "Secure Backend-for-Frontend (BFF) authentication flow for .NET APIs with OAuth 2.0/OIDC support, multi-tenancy, and Keycloak integration. Provides session-based authentication without exposing tokens to clients.",
  "id": "Apped.BffAuth",
