  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.3.0: Enhanced Swagger UI with Logout\n      - Enhanced logout functionality in Swagger UI with confirmation dialog\n      - Real-time user information display with roles and authentication status\n      - Smart button states with hover effects and contextual feedback\n      - Complete session cleanup (both client and server-side)\n      - Visual feedback during logout process with loading states\n      - Improved JavaScript implementation with proper error handling\n      \n      v1.2.0: Swagger UI Integration\n      - Complete Swagger UI integration with \"Authorize (BFF)\" button\n      - Popup-based OAuth authentication flow\n      - Session persistence across browser refreshes\n      - Automatic request header injection\n      - Real-time authentication status updates\n      - Professional UI with gradient styling and animations\n      - Testing utilities for development workflow\n      - Enhanced documentation and examples\n      \n      v1.1.0: Enhanced Security and UX\n      - Improved PKCE implementation\n      - Enhanced state parameter security\n      - Better error handling and logging\n      - UI improvements and accessibility\n      \n      v1.0.0: Initial release\n      - Backend-for-Frontend authentication pattern\n      - OAuth 2.0/OIDC with PKCE support\n      - Keycloak provider implementation\n      - Multi-tenant role-based authorization\n      - Redis and in-memory session storage\n      - Automatic localhost redirect support in development\n      - Comprehensive logout with end-session support",
  "repository": "",
